{"2812190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catatattack!", "steam_appid": 2812190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Catatattack_Text_Logo.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catatattack</strong> is an<strong><i> Action-Adventure Game</i></strong> featuring Grumbly Police Officers, Menacing Mafia Members and a <strong>WHOLE LOTTA CATS!</strong><br><br>Fight your way through increasingly diverse hordes of enemies in <strong>Solo</strong> or <strong>2P Co-op Play</strong> with your <strong>Nimble Dodges</strong> and <strong>Cataclysmic Combos</strong> as you get to the bottom of... whatever the heck is going on in this city????</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Story_Mode.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Humble Housecat, Catat, finds himself in a bit of trouble while searching for a meal! Now he's been <i>(literally) </i>launched into a feud between the Police Precinct and the Mafia Syndicate of this Crazy City famously known as <strong>District 19</strong>. Pick a side and Blitz through the chaotic mess of enemies lurking the halls of either the <strong>District 19 Police Precinct</strong> or the <strong>District 19 Mafia Hideout</strong> all while unraveling a secret plot threatening the safety of every Cat (and human, I guess) in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Combat.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this High Octane Action Game, Combat is<strong> KING!</strong> String together insane combos reaching the skies and beyond, and promptly right back to the ground with a Killer Axe Kick that'd get the cops called! While they read your rights, you'll have ample time to take in the mess of enemy types! Every fight will give you a rush as you change up your approach to take down the newest threat! Don't get comfy, because if you don't keep your defense on high alert, the beatdown will befall <strong>YOU!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Features.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a crack at the <strong>Expansive Story Campaign</strong> to unravel the mysteries of this strange city, either on your own or with a friend in <strong>2 Player Co-op</strong>! Or <strong>Bring the Battle to your Buddies</strong> in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong> as you compete with one another to be the Coolest Cat on the block with a series of Challenges and Competitions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this fun and so much more lurks within District 19, take a step inside and allow your mind to be blown! And always remember that the Mama Moon loves you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Catatattack_Logo.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Catatattack_Text_Logo.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catatattack</strong> is an<strong><i> Action-Adventure Game</i></strong> featuring Grumbly Police Officers, Menacing Mafia Members and a <strong>WHOLE LOTTA CATS!</strong><br><br>Fight your way through increasingly diverse hordes of enemies in <strong>Solo</strong> or <strong>2P Co-op Play</strong> with your <strong>Nimble Dodges</strong> and <strong>Cataclysmic Combos</strong> as you get to the bottom of... whatever the heck is going on in this city????</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Story_Mode.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Humble Housecat, Catat, finds himself in a bit of trouble while searching for a meal! Now he's been <i>(literally) </i>launched into a feud between the Police Precinct and the Mafia Syndicate of this Crazy City famously known as <strong>District 19</strong>. Pick a side and Blitz through the chaotic mess of enemies lurking the halls of either the <strong>District 19 Police Precinct</strong> or the <strong>District 19 Mafia Hideout</strong> all while unraveling a secret plot threatening the safety of every Cat (and human, I guess) in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Combat.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this High Octane Action Game, Combat is<strong> KING!</strong> String together insane combos reaching the skies and beyond, and promptly right back to the ground with a Killer Axe Kick that'd get the cops called! While they read your rights, you'll have ample time to take in the mess of enemy types! Every fight will give you a rush as you change up your approach to take down the newest threat! Don't get comfy, because if you don't keep your defense on high alert, the beatdown will befall <strong>YOU!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Features.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a crack at the <strong>Expansive Story Campaign</strong> to unravel the mysteries of this strange city, either on your own or with a friend in <strong>2 Player Co-op</strong>! Or <strong>Bring the Battle to your Buddies</strong> in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong> as you compete with one another to be the Coolest Cat on the block with a series of Challenges and Competitions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this fun and so much more lurks within District 19, take a step inside and allow your mind to be blown! And always remember that the Mama Moon loves you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/extras/Catatattack_Logo.png?t=1767417461\" /></span></p>", "short_description": "Catatattack is an Action-Adventure Game featuring Grumbly Police Officers, Menacing Mafia Members and a WHOLE LOTTA CATS! Take on the Story Campaign in your pursuit of Adventure or Arcade Mode in your pursuit of Action, all to satiate your never-ending appetite for chaos! And for food.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/eec44923ef95ac5b3b47355de6c4a79830970746/header.jpg?t=1767417461", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/3328140c7dd0bedf3fd207d17ddfd26e31f77e4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767417461", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812190/3328140c7dd0bedf3fd207d17ddfd26e31f77e4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767417461", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><